Bestar Work Hours

This project contains work adapted from Bestar stripSystem, reference commit
1608420b6f5cd160624012b105cb5069261aa569, under the Apache License 2.0.
The applicable license is reproduced in LICENSE.

Extracted components: attendance calculation and parsing, wage-record generation,
legacy BIFF editing, approved sanitized template and manifest, operational time,
SHA-256 helpers, selected regression tests, scoped Work Hours UI and DTOs,
OfficeShell, CSS/theme/language components and brand assets.

Standalone modifications: Python import namespace and packaged template paths;
LF template manifest output; serialization, packaging and development CLI;
persistent attendance API and revision/audit storage; removal of login/roles;
scoped navigation, same-origin proxy, direct parsing/generation, correction UI,
file download links and pagination; local Docker and Vercel configurations.
Synthetic fixtures replace private sample dependencies. No historical payroll
workbook or employee attendance sample is distributed.

Source modules in the reference project: apps/worker-python/src/worker_python/
wage/{attendance,generator,legacy_xls,template}.py and apps/web/src/.
The approved template originates from apps/worker-python/templates/wage/.
See docs/ENGINE-MIGRATION.md in the repository for migration details.
